Install minikube
winget install -e --id Kubernetes.minikube
Commands
1.	Delete all Kubernetes resources
kubectl delete -f k8s/
2.	Stop Minikube
minikube stop
3.	Start Minikube
minikube start
4.	Apply Kubernetes configs
kubectl apply -f k8s/
(we can apply one by one file also)
5.	Check pods
kubectl get pods
6.	Check services
		kubectl get svc
7.	Open frontend service
minikube service express-frontend-service
8.	Quick Restart (Without Deleting Everything)
kubectl rollout restart deployment/flask-backend
kubectl rollout restart deployment/express-frontend

